    {
      "id": "otter2",
      "text": "When they sleep, they hold hands, so the current can't pull them apart.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "pop",
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "otter3",
      "text": "Some even wrap themselves in kelp, like a blanket. And the pups just nap on mom's belly.",
